{"id":"mahabharata-3-124","work":"mahabharata","part":3,"partName":"आरण्यकपर्व","partNameEn":"Aranyaka Parva","unit":124,"title":"चतुर्विंशत्यधिकशततमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 124 · Chyavana gives the Ashvins the Soma","summary":{"en":"In gratitude Chyavana offers the Ashvins a share of Soma at King Sharyati's sacrifice. Indra objects and raises his thunderbolt, but Chyavana paralyses his arm and creates a monstrous demon, Mada, who rushes to devour Indra.","kn":"ಕೃತಜ್ಞತೆಯಿಂದ ಚ್ಯವನರು ಶರ್ಯಾತಿಯ ಯಜ್ಞದಲ್ಲಿ ಅಶ್ವಿನೀದೇವತೆಗಳಿಗೆ ಸೋಮದ ಪಾಲು ಕೊಡುತ್ತಾರೆ. ಇಂದ್ರನು ಆಕ್ಷೇಪಿಸಿ ವಜ್ರ ಎತ್ತಿದಾಗ ಚ್ಯವನರು ಅವನ ತೋಳನ್ನು ಸ್ತಂಭಿಸಿ, ಇಂದ್ರನನ್ನು ನುಂಗಲು ನುಗ್ಗುವ ಮದನೆಂಬ ಭೀಕರ ದಾನವನನ್ನು ಸೃಷ್ಟಿಸುತ್ತಾರೆ.","hi":"कृतज्ञता में च्यवन राजा शर्याति के यज्ञ में अश्विनीकुमारों को सोम का भाग देते हैं। इन्द्र आपत्ति कर वज्र उठाते हैं, पर च्यवन उनकी भुजा स्तम्भित कर देते हैं और मद नामक भयंकर दानव उत्पन्न करते हैं, जो इन्द्र को निगलने दौड़ता है।","te":"కృతజ్ఞతతో చ్యవనుడు శర్యాతి యజ్ఞంలో అశ్వినీదేవతలకు సోమభాగం ఇస్తాడు. ఇంద్రుడు అభ్యంతరపెట్టి వజ్రం ఎత్తగా చ్యవనుడు అతని చేతిని స్తంభింపజేసి, ఇంద్రుని మింగడానికి దూసుకువచ్చే మదుడనే భయంకర దానవుని సృష్టిస్తాడు.","ta":"நன்றியுடன் ச்யவனர் ஶர்யாதியின் யாகத்தில் அஶ்வினிகளுக்கு ஸோமத்தில் பங்கு தருகிறார். இந்திரன் எதிர்த்து வஜ்ரத்தை உயர்த்த, ச்யவனர் அவன் கையை அசையவிடாமல் செய்து, இந்திரனை விழுங்கப் பாயும் மதன் என்ற கொடிய அசுரனைப் படைக்கிறார்.","ml":"കൃതജ്ഞതയോടെ ച്യവനൻ ശര്യാതിയുടെ യാഗത്തിൽ അശ്വിനികൾക്ക് സോമത്തിൽ പങ്കു നൽകുന്നു. ഇന്ദ്രൻ എതിർത്ത് വജ്രമുയർത്തുന്നു; പക്ഷേ ച്യവനൻ അദ്ദേഹത്തിന്റെ കൈ തളർത്തിക്കളഞ്ഞ്, ഇന്ദ്രനെ വിഴുങ്ങാൻ പാഞ്ഞടുക്കുന്ന ഭീകരനായ മദൻ എന്ന രാക്ഷസനെ സൃഷ്ടിക്കുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 3.124; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Mon Apr 11 2022","sections":[{"title":"तीर्थयात्रापर्व","titleEn":"Tirthayatra Parva (The pilgrimage)","verses":[{"text":"लोमश उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Lomasha said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"ततः श्रुत्वा तु शर्यातिर्वयःस्थं च्यवनं कृतम् ।\nसंहृष्टः सेनया सार्धमुपायाद्भार्गवाश्रमम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Sharyati heard that Chyavana had been made young again, and, delighted, he came with his army to the Bhargava's hermitage."}},{"n":2,"text":"च्यवनं च सुकन्यां च दृष्ट्वा देवसुताविव ।\nरेमे महीपः शर्यातिः कृत्स्नां प्राप्य महीमिव ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing Chyavana and Sukanya like two children of the gods, the king rejoiced as though he had won the whole earth."}},{"n":3,"text":"ऋषिणा सत्कृतस्तेन सभार्यः पृथिवीपतिः ।\nउपोपविष्टः कल्याणीः कथाश्चक्रे महामनाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Honoured by the seer, the lord of the earth sat near him with his wife, and the high-minded man talked of pleasant things."}},{"n":4,"text":"अथैनं भार्गवो राजन्नुवाच परिसान्त्वयन् ।\nयाजयिष्यामि राजंस्त्वां संभारानुपकल्पय ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the Bhargava said to him consolingly: \"King, I shall perform a sacrifice for you. Prepare the materials.\""}},{"n":5,"text":"ततः परमसंहृष्टः शर्यातिः पृथिवीपतिः ।\nच्यवनस्य महाराज तद्वाक्यं प्रत्यपूजयत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Greatly pleased, King Sharyati, great king, welcomed Chyavana's words."}},{"n":6,"text":"प्रशस्तेऽहनि यज्ञीये सर्वकामसमृद्धिमत् ।\nकारयामास शर्यातिर्यज्ञायतनमुत्तमम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"On an auspicious day for a sacrifice, Sharyati had a splendid sacrificial ground prepared, rich in everything desirable."}},{"n":7,"text":"तत्रैनं च्यवनो राजन्याजयामास भार्गवः ।\nअद्भुतानि च तत्रासन्यानि तानि निबोध मे ॥","meaning":{"en":"There, king, Chyavana the Bhargava conducted the sacrifice for him. Listen to the marvels that took place there."}},{"n":8,"text":"अगृह्णाच्च्यवनः सोममश्विनोर्देवयोस्तदा ।\nतमिन्द्रो वारयामास गृह्यमाणं तयोर्ग्रहम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Chyavana then took up the soma cup for the two Ashvins, but Indra tried to stop him as he took their share."}},{"text":"इन्द्र उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Indra said:"}},{"n":9,"text":"उभावेतौ न सोमार्हौ नासत्याविति मे मतिः ।\nभिषजौ देवपुत्राणां कर्मणा नैवमर्हतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"I think these two Nasatyas are not worthy of soma. As physicians of the gods' sons, they do not deserve it by their work.\""}},{"text":"च्यवन उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Chyavana said:"}},{"n":10,"text":"मावमंस्था महात्मानौ रूपद्रविणवत्तरौ ।\nयौ चक्रतुर्मां मघवन्वृन्दारकमिवाजरम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"Do not despise these two great-souled ones, Maghavan, who are richer in beauty and wealth, who made me, as it were, a young immortal.\""}},{"n":11,"text":"ऋते त्वां विबुधांश्चान्यान्कथं वै नार्हतः सवम् ।\nअश्विनावपि देवेन्द्र देवौ विद्धि पुरंदर ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"Except for you and the other gods, how can the Ashvins not deserve a share in the sacrifice? Know them, Indra, to be gods too.\""}},{"text":"इन्द्र उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Indra said:"}},{"n":12,"text":"चिकित्सकौ कर्मकरौ कामरूपसमन्वितौ ।\nलोके चरन्तौ मर्त्यानां कथं सोममिहार्हतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"They are healers and labourers, who take what shape they like and wander among mortals. How do they deserve soma here?\""}},{"text":"लोमश उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Lomasha said:"}},{"n":13,"text":"एतदेव यदा वाक्यमाम्रेडयति वासवः ।\nअनादृत्य ततः शक्रं ग्रहं जग्राह भार्गवः ॥","meaning":{"en":"As Vasava kept repeating just this, the Bhargava ignored Indra and took up the cup."}},{"n":14,"text":"ग्रहीष्यन्तं तु तं सोममश्विनोरुत्तमं तदा ।\nसमीक्ष्य बलभिद्देव इदं वचनमब्रवीत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing him about to take the best of soma for the Ashvins, the god who split Bala said:"}},{"n":15,"text":"आभ्यामर्थाय सोमं त्वं ग्रहीष्यसि यदि स्वयम् ।\nवज्रं ते प्रहरिष्यामि घोररूपमनुत्तमम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"If you take soma for these two yourself, I shall hurl at you my dreadful, incomparable thunderbolt.\""}},{"n":16,"text":"एवमुक्तः स्मयन्निन्द्रमभिवीक्ष्य स भार्गवः ।\nजग्राह विधिवत्सोममश्विभ्यामुत्तमं ग्रहम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Spoken to so, the Bhargava smiled, looked at Indra, and took the best cup of soma for the Ashvins according to rule."}},{"n":17,"text":"ततोऽस्मै प्राहरद्वज्रं घोररूपं शचीपतिः ।\nतस्य प्रहरतो बाहुं स्तम्भयामास भार्गवः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the husband of Shachi hurled his dreadful thunderbolt at him, but as he raised his arm to strike, the Bhargava paralysed it."}},{"n":18,"text":"संस्तम्भयित्वा च्यवनो जुहुवे मन्त्रतोऽनलम् ।\nकृत्यार्थी सुमहातेजा देवं हिंसितुमुद्यतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having paralysed it, Chyavana, of great radiance and bent on a magical creation, offered into the fire with a spell, intending to harm the god."}},{"n":19,"text":"ततः कृत्या समभवदृषेस्तस्य तपोबलात् ।\nमदो नाम महावीर्यो बृहत्कायो महासुरः ।\nशरीरं यस्य निर्देष्टुमशक्यं तु सुरासुरैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then, by the power of the seer's austerity, a creature of sorcery arose: the huge, mighty demon named Mada, whose body neither gods nor demons could describe."}},{"n":20,"text":"तस्यास्यमभवद्घोरं तीक्ष्णाग्रदशनं महत् ।\nहनुरेका स्थिता तस्य भूमावेका दिवं गता ॥","meaning":{"en":"His mouth was huge and dreadful, with sharp-pointed teeth. One jaw rested on the earth and the other reached up to heaven."}},{"n":21,"text":"चतस्र आयता दंष्ट्रा योजनानां शतं शतम् ।\nइतरे त्वस्य दशना बभूवुर्दशयोजनाः ।\nप्राकारसदृशाकाराः शूलाग्रसमदर्शनाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Four of his fangs were each a hundred leagues long, and his other teeth were ten leagues long, shaped like ramparts and looking like spear-points."}},{"n":22,"text":"बाहू पर्वतसंकाशावायतावयुतं समौ ।\nनेत्रे रविशशिप्रख्ये वक्त्रमन्तकसंनिभम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"His arms were like mountains, each ten thousand leagues long and equal. His eyes were like the sun and moon, and his mouth like Death's."}},{"n":23,"text":"लेलिहञ्जिह्वया वक्त्रं विद्युच्चपललोलया ।\nव्यात्ताननो घोरदृष्टिर्ग्रसन्निव जगद्बलात् ॥","meaning":{"en":"He licked his gaping mouth with a tongue that flickered like lightning, his gaze terrible, as if he would swallow the world by force."}},{"n":24,"text":"स भक्षयिष्यन्संक्रुद्धः शतक्रतुमुपाद्रवत् ।\nमहता घोररूपेण लोकाञ्शब्देन नादयन् ॥","meaning":{"en":"In rage, intending to devour Indra of the hundred sacrifices, he rushed at him with a huge, terrible form, making the worlds echo with his roar."}}]}]}